{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fahTzCRx6B1792753169.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港高爾夫球公開賽，港將張雄熙次回合後升上榜首。</p><p></p><p>張雄熙首回合並列第五，這天沒洞超標，捉到六隻低一桿的「小鳥」，包括第五、第12及18洞。</p><p></p><p>另有一個洞造出低兩桿的「老鷹」，以低8桿的62完成，總成績低14桿，在家人觀戰下跳升上榜首，獨自領先美國的蘇拉治3桿。另一港將許龍一，造出低4桿的66，升上並列25，林日曦及黑純一並列50，業餘球手林竑希亦晉級。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.768109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:12.662209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:24.795747+00:00","content_hash":"e40405cc52416f2322120998053c81184a153b97085198080e77db2945e454b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}